      "summaries": {
        "en": "Agent Skills is a curated collection of production-grade engineering skills for AI coding agents like Claude Code and Cursor. It solves the problem of agents lacking domain-specific expertise in real-world software engineering tasks. The project provides reusable skill definitions that teach agents how to handle complex workflows, such as debugging, refactoring, or deploying. Technically, it uses structured prompts and tool configurations to encode expert knowledge. You can integrate these skills into your own agent setup to boost its competence on practical coding challenges, making AI assistants more reliable for professional development.",
        "zh": "Agent Skills 是一个为 AI 编程代理（如 Claude Code 和 Cursor）精心策划的生产级工程技能集合。它解决了代理在真实软件工程任务中缺乏领域专业知识的问题。该项目提供可复用的技能定义，教会代理如何处理复杂工作流，例如调试、重构或部署。技术上，它通过结构化提示和工具配置来编码专家知识。你可以将这些技能集成到自己的代理设置中，提升其在实践编码挑战中的能力，使 AI 助手在专业开发中更可靠。",
        "es": "Agent Skills is a curated collection of production-grade engineering skills for AI coding agents like Claude Code and Cursor. It solves the problem of agents lacking domain-specific expertise in real-world software engineering tasks. The project provides reusable skill definitions that teach agents how to handle complex workflows, such as debugging, refactoring, or deploying. Technically, it uses structured prompts and tool configurations to encode expert knowledge. You can integrate these skills into your own agent setup to boost its competence on practical coding challenges, making AI assistants more reliable for professional development.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "agent-skills stands out for agent-skills, antigravity, and antigravity-ide in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Agent Skills is a curated collection of production-grade engineering skills for AI coding agents like Claude Code and Cursor. It solves the problem of agents lacking domain-specific expertise in real-world software engineering tasks. The project provides reusable skill definitions that teach agents how to handle complex workflows, such as debugging, refactoring, or deploying. Technically, it uses structured prompts and tool configurations to encode expert knowledge. You can integrate these skills into your own agent setup to boost its competence on practical coding challenges, making AI assistants more reliable for professional development.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
